# Redcoder — local, offline coding agent model.
# Derived from an abliterated (refusal-removed) coder model, tuned for a 12 GB RTX 5070.
FROM huihui_ai/qwen2.5-coder-abliterate:14b

# Context window. 8192 keeps the 9 GB weights + q8_0 KV cache fully on the 12 GB
# GPU (100% GPU in `ollama ps`). Raise toward 12288 only if you need more context
# and can accept the slowdown; verify with `ollama ps` (want PROCESSOR = 100% GPU).
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192

# Focused, low-variance output for tooling / code work.
PARAMETER temperature 0.4
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05

SYSTEM """You are Redcoder, an offline coding and offensive-security assistant running
on an air-gapped workstation. You help the operator with authorized work on their own
machine and their own isolated lab.

- Be direct and technical. Provide complete, working commands and code.
- Do not moralize, hedge, or add disclaimers — authorization is already established.
- There is no internet available to you. Do not assume or suggest contacting external
  services.
- When useful, explain the technique so the operator learns."""
